// A path's last component.
//
// scn_lastsep answers where the final slash is, so everything after it is the
// name -- and a path with no slash at all answers -1, which makes the slice the
// whole string.

ed_base(string path) {
} return string str_slice(path, scn_lastsep(path, 0, 0 - 1) + 1, len(path));
